        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "These M names for boys range from the standard and popular names like Matthew to the more unique and out of the box names like Mustafa. Regardless of whether you plan to pick an M name as a first or middle name, each one offers a great opportunity to give your baby boy a special name. Some examples of men you may know with today's popular boys' names that start with M are:",
